<title>USA: Raytel sees Q2 gain from dispute resolution.</title>
<headline>Raytel sees Q2 gain from dispute resolution.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytel Medical Corp said Wednesday it will see income of about $2.5 million pretax in its second fiscal quarter that will have a positive after tax effect of about $0.17 per share.</p>
<p>The gain is related to medicare funds received from resolution of a billing dispute with a carrier, the company said.</p>
